{
  "id": "JHN.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 8",
  "verseCount": 59,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Yesu eidho wi got Zeituni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pir kugweno ebino kendo i hekalu, dhanu ceke de gibino i bang’e; man ebedo piny eponjogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jugorcik ku Jufarisayo de gikelo dhaku ma jurube m’ebegiere swa; e ka gikethe i diere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "giwacu ire kumae, Japonji, dhaku maeni jurube wi gier, kpa wi gier. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 20:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.22.22+DEU.22.23+DEU.22.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 22:22-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u i cik re Musa ng’olo iwa ya waneg wagi ma kumeni acanya ku kidi; ka kumeno in ke iwacu ang’o pire? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwacu maeni, ma gibidhe ko, kara ginwang’ agobe i wie. Ento Yesu gung’ piny, man egoro wi ng’om ku lwete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka gipenje asu, etingre malu, ewacu igi kumae, Ng’atu ma dubo mbe kude i kindwu ci, dong’ ekwong’ canye ku kidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egung’ piny kendo, man egoro wi ng’om ku lwete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gin, ka giwinjo lembe maeni, giwok woko acel acel uthekre kum jadit, cil kum m’udong’ cen: man Yesu dong’ kende, ku dhaku, ma ni i diere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yesu tingre malu, man ewacu ire kumae, Dhaku, gini kani? ng’atu moko mbe m’upoko lembe i wii raci? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ewacu kumae, Ng’atu moko mbe Rwoth. E Yesu wacu kumae, An bende apoko lembe rac i wii ngo: cidh i yo peri; ugambre kawono kud idong’ idub kendo.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 5:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.9.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 9:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu lund uyero igi kendo, ewacu kumae, An a der m’i ng’om; ng’atu m’ulubo ng’eya biwotho i mudho ngo, ento ebibedo ku der mi kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.5.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 5:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Jufarisayo wacu ire kumae, Inyutho lembe piri giri; nyutholembe peri en e andha ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu dwoko lembe ewacu igi kumae, Kadok anyuth lembe pira gira, nyutholembe para en e andha; kum ang’eyo ka m’aai i ie, ku ka m’acidho i ie de; ento wun wung’eyo ngo ka m’aai i ie, kadi ka m’acidho i ie de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wupoko lembe calku kum; an apoko lembe kum ng’atu moko ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo tek apoko lembe, pokolembe para en e andha: kum an a kenda ngo, ento waku Wego m’uora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo man i cik mu egore kumae, ya nyutholembe mi juario en e andha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An a ng’atu m’ubenyutho lembe pira gira, Wego m’uora de benyutho lembe pira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno giwacu ire kumae, Wuru nikani? Yesu loko lembe kumae, Wung’eya ngo, kadok Vwa de: dok wung’eya kuno di wung’eyo Vwa bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyero lembuni i kakanpiny, kinde m’eponjo i hekalu: man ng’atu moko mbe m’umake; kum saa pare fokuwok ungo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno ewacu igi kendo kumae, Aai woko man wubiyenya, e wubitho i dubo mu: ka m’acidho i ie wucopo bino ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Juyahudi giwacu kumae, Ebinegre gire, kum ewacu kumae, Ka m’acidho i ie, wucopo bino ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ewacu igi kumae, Wun wuai piny; an aai malu: wun wu mi ng’om maeni; an a mi ng’om maeni ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ketho awacu iwu nia wubitho i dubo mu: kum tek wuyio ngo nia an a en, wubitho i dubo mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno giwacu ire kumae, In i ng’a? Yesu wacu igi kumae, Cil maeno bende m’ayero iwu ku kwong’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giki dupa ni kuda m’ayer apok de piwu: ento ng’atu m’uora en e andha; man gin m’awinjo i bang’e, e ayero ginde ni ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ging’eyo ngo nia eyero igi pi Wego. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Yesu wacu kumae, Ka wudaru ting’o Wod dhanu malu wubilund ng’eyo nia an a en man nia atimo gin moko gira ngo, endre ayero gin maeni calu Wego ponja ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’atu m’uora eni karacelo kuda; eweka kenda ngo, kum atimo gin maeno thiri thiri ma nyayu mutoro i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kan eyero gin maeni, dhanu dupa giyio ire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Yesu wacu ni Juyahudi maeno m’uyie kumae, Tek wubedo i lem para, nwang’u wu julubna mandha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wubing’eyo lemandha, e lemandhane bigonyowu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 3:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 3:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giloko lembe ire kumae, Wan wa kodhi Ibrahim, fodi wabedo ng’eca pa ng’atu moko ngo: iwacu nenedi, Wubigonjru? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu loko lembe igi kumae, Andhandha awacu iwu, Ku ba dhanu ceke ma timo dubo en e jamiru mi dubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jamiru bedo i ot nja ngo: wod e ma bedo mi nja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno tek Wod bigonyowu, wubibedo agonya andha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang’eyo nia wu kodhi Ibrahim; ento wuyenyo ka nega, kum ka lembe para mbe i iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayero gin m’aneno ba Vwa: wun bende wutimo gin ma wuneno ba wegwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giloko lembe giwacu ire kumae, Wegwa en e Ibrahim. Yesu wacu igi kumae, Tek wu nyithindho pa Ibrahim kuno di wutimo tic pa Ibrahim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kawono wuyenyo ka nega an m’a ng’atu m’ayero iwu lemandha, m’awinjo ba Mungu: maeni Ibrahim utimo ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutimo tic pa wegwu. Giwacu ire kumae, Junyolowa ku tarwang’ ungo; Wegwa acel, en e Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wacu igi kumae, Dok Mungu en e Wegwu, kuno di wumara: kum aai ba Mungu abino eni; kum abino gira ngo, ento eora en. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedi wung’eyo wec para ngo? en e kum wucopo winjo lembe para ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wun wu pa wegwu ma wonabali, e wuyenyo wutim awanya ma rac pa wegwu. Cil ku kwong’a en e janek, man ecungo ngo i lemandha, kum lemandha mbe i ie. Kan eyero ndra, eyero kum gin m’ebedo ko: kum en e jandra, man e won ndrane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kum ayero lemandha, wuyia ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’a ma ni i kindwu m’utuco wia kum dubo? Tek ayero lemandha wuyia ngo nedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu ma en e pa Mungu ewinjo lembe pa Mungu: kum lembe nini wuwinjo ngo, kum wu pa Mungu ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juyahudi giloko lembe giwacu ire kumae, Wayero dre ngo nia i Jasamaria, man pajogi ni ii? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu loko lembe kumae, Pajogi mbe i ia; ento ayungo Vwa, man wun re ma wuketho abedo umbe yung. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ayenyo kadwong’ para gira ngo: ng’atu acel nuti m’ubeyenyo m’ubepoko lembe de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andhandha, ayero iwu kumae, Tek ng’atu moko woro lem para, ebineno tho ki ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juyahudi wacu ire kumae, Kawono wapoing’eyo nia pajogi ni ii. Ibrahim utho ku jubila bende; man iwacu kumae, Tek ng’atu moko woro lem para, ebibilo tho ki ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In i dit ma sagu wegwa Ibrahim, m’utho? man jubila bende tho: ikethri ni ng’a? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu loko lembe kumae, Tek ayungra gira, nwang’u dwong’ para en e gin moko ngo: en e Vwa e m’uyunga: ma wuwacu pire, nia en e Mungu mu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wung’eye ngo: ento ang’eye; man tek awacu ya ang’eye ngo, abibedo jandra calu wun: ento ang’eye, man aworo lem pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wegwu ma Ibrahim anyong’a nege kum ebineno ceng’ para: man enene, anyong’a nege de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Juyahudi giwacu ire kumae, Rundi peri fodi pier abic ungo, man ineno Ibrahimu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wacu igi kumae, Andhandha, awacu iwu, Ku kwong’a ma fodi jukunyolo Ibrahim ungo, nwang’u anuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilund giting’o kidi nik gicanye ko: ento Yesu pale gire, man ewok ku i hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.59"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
